### Home config (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/config/home/buyer

### Home V2
GET {{baseUrl}}/config/homev2/buyer

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/config/category

### Category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/config/category?catId=1

### Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=english

### Search tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/search-tags?q=kids

### Foundation data
GET {{baseUrl}}/foundation

### Get doc by key
GET {{baseUrl}}/doc/terms

### Save feedback (auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/config/feedback?api_token={{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is feedback"
}

### V3 Home (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/home

### V3 Home (auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/auth/home?api_token={{apiToken}}

### V3 Listing
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/listing

### V3 Map
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/map?lat=10.77&lng=106.69&radius=5

### V3 Search filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/search

### V3 Partner profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/partner/1

### V3 Main subtypes
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/main-subtypes/online
